            </math>
        </region><region region-id="86" left="40" top="2883" width="540" height="20" align-x="40" align-y="2897" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
                <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">4. Calor Específico Másico [J/(kg*K)]:  (1: 2,4-DM-tridecano | 2: 2,4-DM-tetradecano | 3: Hexadecano | Mezcla)</p>
            </text>
        </region><region region-id="87" left="40" top="2911" width="120" height="30" align-x="40" align-y="2929" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
                <ml:eval placeholderMultiplicationStyle="default"><ml:apply><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="1">cp</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="0">T</ml:id></ml:apply></ml:eval>
            </math>
        </region><region region-id="88" left="170" top="2911" width="120" height="30" align-x="170" align-y="2929" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
                <ml:eval placeholderMultiplicationStyle="default"><ml:apply><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="2">cp</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="0">T</ml:id></ml:apply></ml:eval>
            </math>
        </region><region region-id="89" left="300" top="2911" width="120" height="30" align-x="300" align-y="2929" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
                <ml:eval placeholderMultiplicationStyle="default"><ml:apply><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="3">cp</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="0">T</ml:id></ml:apply></ml:eval>
            </math>
        </region><region region-id="90" left="430" top="2911" width="130" height="30" align-x="430" align-y="2929" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
                <ml:eval placeholderMultiplicationStyle="default"><ml:apply><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="M">cp</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="0">T</ml:id></ml:apply></ml:eval>
            </math>
        </region><region region-id="91" left="40" top="2984" width="540" height="22" align-x="40" align-y="3000" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
                <p style="Heading 2" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">10. Inciso e) Propiedades del Aire Gaseoso (Capítulo 4 - Yaws Handbook)</p>
            </text>
        </region><region region-id="92" left="40" top="3019" width="540" height="20" align-x="40" align-y="3033" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
                <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Estimación de propiedades para el aire gaseoso a baja presión en función de T:</p>
            </text>
        </region><region region-id="93" left="40" top="3049" width="500" height="30" align-x="40" align-y="3067" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
                <ml:define>
        <ml:function>
            <ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="aire">cp</ml:id>
            <ml:boundVars><ml:id xml:space="preserve">T</ml:id></ml:boundVars>
        </ml:function>
        <ml:apply><ml:div /><ml:apply><ml:mult /><ml:parens><ml:apply><ml:plus /><ml:apply><ml:plus /><ml:apply><ml:plus /><ml:real>29.643</ml:real><ml:apply><ml:mult /><ml:real>-0.0051373</ml:real><ml:apply><ml:div /><ml:id xml:space="preserve">T</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve">K</ml:id></ml:apply></ml:apply></ml:apply><ml:apply><ml:mult /><ml:real>1.3106e-05</ml:real><ml:apply><ml:pow /><ml:apply><ml:div /><ml:id xml:space="preserve">T</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve">K</ml:id></ml:apply><ml:real>2</ml:real></ml:apply></ml:apply></ml:apply><ml:apply><ml:mult /><ml:real>-4.8325e-09</ml:real><ml:apply><ml:pow /><ml:apply><ml:div /><ml:id xml:space="preserve">T</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve">K</ml:id></ml:apply><ml:real>3</ml:real></ml:apply></ml:apply></ml:apply></ml:parens><ml:apply><ml:div /><ml:id xml:space="preserve">joule</ml:id><ml:apply><ml:mult /><ml:id xml:space="preserve">mole</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve">K</ml:id></ml:apply></ml:apply></ml:apply><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="aire">MW</ml:id></ml:apply>
    </ml:define>
            </math>
        </region><region region-id="94" left="40" top="3099" width="500" height="30" align-x="40" align-y="3117" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
                <ml:define>
        <ml:function>
            <ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="aire">k</ml:id>
            <ml:boundVars><ml:id xml:space="preserve">T</ml:id></ml:boundVars>
        </ml:function>
        <ml:apply><ml:mult /><ml:parens><ml:apply><ml:plus /><ml:apply><ml:plus /><ml:apply><ml:plus /><ml:real>-0.00038603</ml:real><ml:apply><ml:mult /><ml:real>0.00010311</ml:real><ml:apply><ml:div /><ml:id xml:space="preserve">T</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve">K</ml:id></ml:apply></ml:apply></ml:apply><ml:apply><ml:mult /><ml:real>-5.4199e-08</ml:real><ml:apply><ml:pow /><ml:apply><ml:div /><ml:id xml:space="preserve">T</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve">K</ml:id></ml:apply><ml:real>2</ml:real></ml:apply></ml:apply></ml:apply><ml:apply><ml:mult /><ml:real>1.7429e-11</ml:real><ml:apply><ml:pow /><ml:apply><ml:div /><ml:id xml:space="preserve">T</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve">K</ml:id></ml:apply><ml:real>3</ml:real></ml:apply></ml:apply></ml:apply></ml:parens><ml:apply><ml:div /><ml:id xml:space="preserve">watt</ml:id><ml:apply><ml:mult /><ml:id xml:space="preserve">m</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve">K</ml:id></ml:apply></ml:apply></ml:apply>
    </ml:define>
            </math>
        </region><region region-id="95" left="40" top="3149" width="500" height="30" align-x="40" align-y="3167" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
                <ml:define>
        <ml:function>
            <ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="aire">mu</ml:id>
            <ml:boundVars><ml:id xml:space="preserve">T</ml:id></ml:boundVars>
        </ml:function>
        <ml:apply><ml:mult /><ml:parens><ml:apply><ml:plus /><ml:apply><ml:plus /><ml:apply><ml:plus /><ml:real>4.5608</ml:real><ml:apply><ml:mult /><ml:real>0.70077</ml:real><ml:apply><ml:div /><ml:id xml:space="preserve">T</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve">K</ml:id></ml:apply></ml:apply></ml:apply><ml:apply><ml:mult /><ml:real>-0.00037287</ml:real><ml:apply><ml:pow /><ml:apply><ml:div /><ml:id xml:space="preserve">T</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve">K</ml:id></ml:apply><ml:real>2</ml:real></ml:apply></ml:apply></ml:apply><ml:apply><ml:mult /><ml:real>9.0437e-08</ml:real><ml:apply><ml:pow /><ml:apply><ml:div /><ml:id xml:space="preserve">T</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve">K</ml:id></ml:apply><ml:real>3</ml:real></ml:apply></ml:apply></ml:apply></ml:parens><ml:apply><ml:mult /><ml:real>1e-07</ml:real><ml:apply><ml:mult /><ml:id xml:space="preserve">Pa</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve">s</ml:id></ml:apply></ml:apply></ml:apply>
    </ml:define>
            </math>
        </region><region region-id="96" left="40" top="3204" width="540" height="20" align-x="40" align-y="3218" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
                <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Evaluación de Propiedades del Aire a 298.15 K en Sistema Internacional (SI):</p>
            </text>
        </region><region region-id="97" left="40" top="3232" width="150" height="30" align-x="40" align-y="3250" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
                <ml:eval placeholderMultiplicationStyle="default"><ml:apply><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="aire">cp</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="0">T</ml:id></ml:apply></ml:eval>
            </math>
        </region><region region-id="98" left="210" top="3232" width="150" height="30" align-x="210" align-y="3250" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
                <ml:eval placeholderMultiplicationStyle="default"><ml:apply><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="aire">k</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="0">T</ml:id></ml:apply></ml:eval>
            </math>
        </region><region region-id="99" left="380" top="3232" width="150" height="30" align-x="380" align-y="3250" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
                <ml:eval placeholderMultiplicationStyle="default"><ml:apply><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="aire">mu</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="0">T</ml:id></ml:apply></ml:eval>
            </math>
        </region><region region-id="100" left="40" top="3305" width="540" height="22" align-x="40" align-y="3321" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
                <p style="Heading 2" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">11. Rango de Temperatura y Variables para Gráficos (270 K a 500 K)</p>
            </text>
        </region><region region-id="101" left="40" top="3340" width="540" height="20" align-x="40" align-y="3354" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
                <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Definición de rangos de temperatura con y sin unidades para graficar:</p>
            </text>
        </region><region region-id="102" left="40" top="3368" width="180" height="30" align-x="40" align-y="3386" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
                <ml:define><ml:id xml:space="preserve">T</ml:id><ml:sequence><ml:apply><ml:mult /><ml:real>270</ml:real><ml:id xml:space="preserve">K</ml:id></ml:apply><ml:apply><ml:mult /><ml:real>275</ml:real><ml:id xml:space="preserve">K</ml:id></ml:apply><ml:apply><ml:mult /><ml:real>500</ml:real><ml:id xml:space="preserve">K</ml:id></ml:apply></ml:sequence></ml:define>
            </math>
        </region><region region-id="103" left="260" top="3368" width="160" height="30" align-x="260" align-y="3386" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
                <ml:define><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="ad">T</ml:id><ml:sequence><ml:real>270</ml:real><ml:real>275</ml:real><ml:real>500</ml:real></ml:sequence></ml:define>
            </math>
        </region><region region-id="104" left="40" top="3418" width="540" height="20" align-x="40" align-y="3432" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
                <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Funciones auxiliares adimensionales para graficar de forma directa:</p>
            </text>
        </region><region region-id="105" left="40" top="3446" width="130" height="30" align-x="40" align-y="3464" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
                <ml:define>
        <ml:function>
            <ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="p">mu1</ml:id>
            <ml:boundVars><ml:id xml:space="preserve">T</ml:id></ml:boundVars>
        </ml:function>
        <ml:apply><ml:div /><ml:apply><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="1">mu</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve">T</ml:id></ml:apply><ml:id xml:space="preserve">cP</ml:id></ml:apply>
    </ml:define>
            </math>
        </region><region region-id="106" left="180" top="3446" width="130" height="30" align-x="180" align-y="3464" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
                <ml:define>
        <ml:function>
            <ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="p">mu2</ml:id>
            <ml:boundVars><ml:id xml:space="preserve">T</ml:id></ml:boundVars>
        </ml:function>
        <ml:apply><ml:div /><ml:apply><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="2">mu</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve">T</ml:id></ml:apply><ml:id xml:space="preserve">cP</ml:id></ml:apply>
    </ml:define>
            </math>
        </region><region region-id="107" left="320" top="3446" width="130" height="30" align-x="320" align-y="3464" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
                <ml:define>
        <ml:function>
            <ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="p">mu3</ml:id>
            <ml:boundVars><ml:id xml:space="preserve">T</ml:id></ml:boundVars>
        </ml:function>
        <ml:apply><ml:div /><ml:apply><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="3">mu</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve">T</ml:id></ml:apply><ml:id xml:space="preserve">cP</ml:id></ml:apply>
    </ml:define>
            </math>
        </region><region region-id="108" left="460" top="3446" width="130" height="30" align-x="460" align-y="3464" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
                <ml:define>
        <ml:function>
            <ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="p">muM</ml:id>
            <ml:boundVars><ml:id xml:space="preserve">T</ml:id></ml:boundVars>
        </ml:function>
        <ml:apply><ml:div /><ml:apply><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="M">mu</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve">T</ml:id></ml:apply><ml:id xml:space="preserve">cP</ml:id></ml:apply>
    </ml:define>
            </math>
        </region><region region-id="109" left="40" top="3501" width="540" height="20" align-x="40" align-y="3515" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
                <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">INSTRUCCIONES CLARAS PARA INSERTAR LOS GRÁFICOS (X-Y PLOT):</p>
            </text>
        </region><region region-id="110" left="40" top="3527" width="540" height="20" align-x="40" align-y="3541" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
                <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">1. Inserte un gráfico presionando Ctrl + 2 (o menú Insertar -&gt; Gráfico -&gt; Gráfico X-Y).</p>
            </text>
        </region><region region-id="111" left="40" top="3551" width="540" height="20" align-x="40" align-y="3565" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
                <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">2. En el eje horizontal (marcador central abajo), ingrese exactamente: T</p>
            </text>
        </region><region region-id="112" left="40" top="3575" width="540" height="20" align-x="40" align-y="3589" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
                <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">3. En el eje vertical (marcador central izquierda), ingrese las trazas separadas por coma:</p>
            </text>
        </region><region region-id="113" left="40" top="3599" width="540" height="20" align-x="40" align-y="3613" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
                <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">   - Gráfico de Viscosidad:  mu1_p(T) , mu2_p(T) , mu3_p(T) , muM_p(T)</p>
            </text>
        </region><region region-id="114" left="40" top="3623" width="540" height="20" align-x="40" align-y="3637" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
                <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">   - Gráfico de Densidad:    rho_1(T)/(g/cm^3) , rho_2(T)/(g/cm^3) , rho_3(T)/(g/cm^3) , rho_M(T)/(g/cm^3)</p>
            </text>
        </region><region region-id="115" left="40" top="3647" width="540" height="20" align-x="40" align-y="3661" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
                <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">   - Gráfico de Conductividad: k_1(T)/(watt/(m*K)) , k_2(T)/(watt/(m*K)) , k_3(T)/(watt/(m*K)) , k_M(T)/(watt/(m*K))</p>
            </text>
        </region><region region-id="116" left="40" top="3671" width="540" height="20" align-x="40" align-y="3685" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
                <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">   - Gráfico de Calor Específico: cp_1(T)/(joule/(kg*K)) , cp_2(T)/(joule/(kg*K)) , cp_3(T)/(joule/(kg*K)) , cp_M(T)/(joule/(kg*K))</p>
            </text>
        </region><region region-id="117" left="40" top="3697" width="540" height="20" align-x="40" align-y="3711" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
                <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">4. Configuración de Markers en Viscosidad:</p>
            </text>
        </region><region region-id="118" left="40" top="3721" width="540" height="20" align-x="40" align-y="3735" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
                <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">   Haga doble clic en el gráfico de viscosidad -&gt; pestaña 'Ejes X-Y' -&gt; active 'Markers'.</p>
            </text>
        </region><region region-id="119" left="40" top="3745" width="540" height="20" align-x="40" align-y="3759" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
                <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">   En los dos marcadores del eje X coloque: 273*K y 340*K  (o 273 y 340 si el eje X es T/K).</p>
            </text>
        </region><region region-id="120" left="40" top="3769" width="540" height="20" align-x="40" align-y="3783" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
            <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
                <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">   En los dos marcadores del eje Y coloque: 4.053 y 1.167.</p>
            </text>
        </region></regions>
	<binaryContent>
		<item item-id="1">iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAD0AAAARCAYAAABuDKSkAAAAAXNSR0IArs4c6QAAAARnQU1B
